          "key": "Flour, all-purpose"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Add the flour. Pulse rapidly 20–30 times, scraping the bowl, until the dough nearly forms a ball. Flatten into a thick disk, wrap and chill 1 h."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">400 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(204 °C)</span></span>, rack in the lower third. Butter the pan and remove the ring. Press a bit under half the dough thin over the base. Bake until pale golden, ≈8 min. Cool completely. Oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">525 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(274 °C)</span></span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Roll the rest into an 8 × 6 in rectangle and cut crosswise into four 2 in strips. Reattach the ring. Press the strips around the side, patching the gap with scraps. Chill."
