  "notes": [
    "Dense and cake-like, not creamy: more eggs and some flour, only a little cream, and no water bath.",
    "Scaled to 8 in from Patent’s 9 in recipe (×0.8). The 2 yolks are rounded up from 1.6.",
    "Check the oven with a thermometer. The <span class=\"rc-nw\">200 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(93 °C)</span></span> stage only works if the oven really holds that.",
    "Patent prefers Neufchâtel (less fat). The numbers are for Philadelphia Original. His strawberry sauce is left off."
